# Absolving Lammasu (4/3 flying): "When this creature enters, all suspected creatures are no longer suspected." (CR 701.60a). Bot1's Case of the Stashed Skeleton suspects its Skeleton on
# turn 1, and on turn 3 its J. Jonah Jameson suspects Bot2's Memnite. On turn 5 Bot1 casts the Lammasu with five Moxen: the Skeleton and the Memnite, one of each player's, are no longer suspected,
# so the Skeleton blocks again, and the Lammasu, which was never suspected, is a plain flyer; Bot2's Ornithopter, never suspected, is as it was.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Case of the Stashed Skeleton
J. Jonah Jameson
Absolving Lammasu
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
